    "3. Say what the person wrote, exactly, which of the list's consents they gave and their own words that gave it. The AI calls tools:run for tool:keep-the-words-a-person-gave with list, rows, row_id (or who), words, consent and consent_note, then keeps the answer's keep rows in your store, each only where the row still holds its expected value.",
    "4. Read row_id, status (received) and changed. Changed words are reviewed again: approve them with tool:approve-words-to-show."
